---
// Organism: CTA (Call to Action) Section
// "Detené el caos. Subí el nivel."
---

<section class="landing-container relative landing-section-compact overflow-hidden mb-16 md:mb-20" id="registro">
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#121614] to-[#0A0D0B] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-16 lg:p-20 text-center relative overflow-hidden border border-primary/20 shadow-xl group">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary/10 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-1000"></div>
    
    <div class="landing-eyebrow bg-white/5 border border-border text-stone-300 mb-6 backdrop-blur-md relative z-10">Activá Tu Negocio Hoy</div>
    
    <h1 class="font-headline font-bold text-white mb-6 relative z-10 drop-shadow-md" style="font-size: var(--text-display); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.04em;">
      Detené el <span class="italic text-primary">caos.</span> <br/>
      Subí el nivel.
    </h1>
    <p class="landing-lead text-text-secondary font-body mb-8 mx-auto relative z-10">
      En 5 minutos tu link de reservas estará activo y listo para cobrar pagos por seña.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 relative z-10">
      <a href="/auth/signup/plan" class="bg-primary text-on-secondary px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-headline font-bold text-base hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(162,207,203,0.4)] transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
        Probalo hoy <i class="ri-rocket-line text-base"></i>
      </a>
      <a href="#pricing" class="px-6 py-4 rounded-full font-headline font-medium text-sm text-white border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/10 hover:scale-105 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
        Ver planes <i class="ri-price-tag-3-line text-base"></i>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="text-text-primary/70 text-xs mt-6 font-body relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5">
      <i class="ri-lock-line text-[10px]"></i> Tarjeta no requerida para probar.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
